# Project Structure

## Library (src/)
- `src/components/InkEditor/` — editor + toolbar subcomponents
- `src/constants/` — defaults, numbers, typo dictionary
- `src/types/` — public and internal types
- `src/utils/` — typo fix, className helpers
- `src/plugins/ai/` — AI agent stub interface
- `src/angular/` — Angular usage helpers / thin adapter entry
- `src/styles/ink.css` — shipped as `dist/styles.css`

## WordPress
- `wordpress/ink-editor/` — PHP plugin stub + assets placeholder

## Portal
- Companion repo: `ink-portal` (demos with Bear chrome)

Every folder has an `index.ts` barrel export.
